{"id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-arithmetical-language.md","title":"Arithmetical Language","display":"df-arithmetical-language — Arithmetical Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-arithmetical-language","aliases":["89-df-arithmetical-language"],"display":"df-arithmetical-language — Arithmetical Language","depends_on":["[[../58/batch17/58-df-formula]]","[[../88/88-df-numeral]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-arithmetical-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-arithmetical-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetical-language — Arithmetical Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../58/batch17/58-df-formula\">../58/batch17/58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"../88/88-df-numeral\">../88/88-df-numeral</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../58/batch17/58-df-formula\">../58/batch17/58-df-formula</a> 的有限一阶语法树构造，实例化变量集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>签名常元为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，函数符号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,+,\\times\">\\(S,+,\\times\\)</span>，元数分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,2,2\">\\(1,2,2\\)</span>；等号为逻辑等号，关系符号集为空。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S\\)</span> 为上游项集接口，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 是下面实例化的项集；等式写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=u\">\\(t=u\\)</span> 对应上游构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\doteq u\">\\(t\\doteq u\\)</span>；算术表达式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}=0=S0\">\\(\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}=0=S0\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span> 表示下述递归的自由变元函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[t/x]\">\\(\\varphi[t/x]\\)</span> 总取避免捕获的替换，绑定变元按最小可用指标先改名。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 中是签名标签，公理集在下一定义中给出；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 为上游通用语法接口。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\coloneqq( \\{0\\},\\{S,+,\\times\\},\n\\{(S,1),(+,2),(\\times,2)\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{v_i\\},\\quad \\mathrm{FV}(0)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(St)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(t+u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(t\\times u)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(t=u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(A\\lor B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(A\\to B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\forall x A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\exists xA)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\mid\n\\mathrm{FV}(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\bar0&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq S\\bar n,\\quad\n\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq(0=S0).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\coloneqq( \\{0\\},\\{S,+,\\times\\},\n\\{(S,1),(+,2),(\\times,2)\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{v_i\\},\\quad \\mathrm{FV}(0)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(St)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(t+u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(t\\times u)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(t=u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(A\\lor B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(A\\to B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\forall x A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\exists xA)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\mid\n\\mathrm{FV}(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\bar0&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq S\\bar n,\\quad\n\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq(0=S0).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 2 章，印刷页 15–17；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n这里复用一般一阶语法，补充 PA 的具体签名、数词和自由变元；它并非整数最大公因子意义的“arithmetic”。上游原始逻辑构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\">\\(\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\exists\">\\(\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\exists\\)</span> 按经典定义先展开；所有递归沿有限语法树下降。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../58/batch17/58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../58/batch17/58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"../88/88-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"69c0e9e2e8f423a6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../88/88-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"../58/batch17/58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[../58/batch17/58-df-formula]] 的有限一阶语法树构造，实例化变量集为 $\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\mathbb N\\}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"S,+,\\times","display":false},{"tex":"1,2,2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trm}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"t=u","display":false},{"tex":"t\\doteq u","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}=0=S0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi[t/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}&\\coloneqq( \\{0\\},\\{S,+,\\times\\},\n\\{(S,1),(+,2),(\\times,2)\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(v_i)&\\coloneqq\\{v_i\\},\\quad \\mathrm{FV}(0)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(St)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(t+u)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(t\\times u)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(t=u)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(A\\lor B)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(A\\to B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\forall x A)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\exists xA)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\mid\n\\mathrm{FV}(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\bar0&\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq S\\bar n,\\quad\n\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq(0=S0).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg,\\lor,\\forall","display":false},{"tex":"\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\exists","display":false}],"bytes":3024,"backlinks":[{"id":"508219e8b4c7dadf","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2e7227755a8473e0","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f367207d33b1e75f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"995dd9138f5c3e5a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e8a3a16d1e5a3f9b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f748d191ce42f6ef","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"15c083801acd41a1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"571230a8af3bcd56","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"97b68cd750e79cac","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4a8ab8e4bad7b12d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]] → [[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]] → [[89-df-peano-arithmetic]] → [[89-df-provability-predicate]] → [[89-df-sigma-one-formula]] → [[89-thm-sigma-one-completeness]] → [[89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions]]"}],"outgoing":["65418b505fc53093","69c0e9e2e8f423a6"]}